            "body": "Are you asking for a formal API which allows editing the `undotree()` ?\n\nThe \"watch\" behavior that you showed is already possible, by setting the 'autoread' option (Nvim 0.13 / master). Confirm which Nvim version you are using.\n\nAnd the `nvim --updated` thing is already possible just by running `:edit` on the file: the undotree, and the undofile, will update.",
